	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You gain an expertise die on checks made to resist being grappled and the grappled condition.</p><p>Additionally, so long as the surface that you are currently on is not considered difficult terrain, when you take the Dash action you may choose to slide an additional 10 feet in the direction in which you were traveling. This movement must be in a straight line and cannot be broken up in any way, and it does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>",
